town Lodge in New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n\n**Booked in two steps, not together:** I tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. Sending book_trip again would have booked and charged the flight a second time, so I booked the hotel on its own. A final check shows exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014dHmZuazbiTo9eZ6SmXEkR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FrMZN5SmXEJuvAtP1ayK4W", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Cheapest nonstop: F100 ($289). Cheapest hotel under $250/night: H1 Midtown Lodge ($378 for 2 nights). Total $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015FsteZJ7MFzNidFc9aFjSj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Timed out \u2014 checking current state before any retry.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BzPPSSoPkm5JJ2gpLtjS3f", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null,